# The hero's weapon and circlet (HeroWeapon, HeroCirclet) at a Monument of Heroes, asked by a hero. The weapon
# list opens and a pick is given with no page, a second pick too (the list's other links stay open); the
# monument then says the hero has one (each answer follows the monument's own page, which the bypass needs). An event naming no hero's weapon, or not a number, answers nothing.
# The circlet is given with a message, then refused as already held.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (HeroWeapon.onTalk, onAdvEvent, HeroCirclet.onTalk) and
# replay the reference trace.
